7. Precautions

1. Check the IC pin configurations before making connections.
2. Ensure the power supply is switched off while changing connections.
3. Avoid short circuits between the supply pins.
4. Apply every input combination carefully.
5. Observe the Sum and Carry outputs separately.

8. Observation

The Sum and Carry outputs were observed for all possible input combinations of the half adder and full adder.

9. Result

Half-adder and full-adder circuits were constructed using XOR and NAND gates, and their operations were verified using the truth tables.
